  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The novel treats weapon path as a newly produced named cultivation path rather than as a label for any Gu that looks like a weapon. Weapon path sits among the handful of cultivation paths, alongside painting path and pill path, absent from every one of Spectral Soul’s dream realms, which leaves Fang Yuan with no attainment in it.",
      "chapters": [
        2150
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan raises most cultivation paths from dream realms, weapon path remains blank with painting path and pill path. Those paths do not exist in Spectral Soul’s dream realms, and the narration places their production after Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable’s era.",
      "chapters": [
        2150
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Weapon path was crudely created by Heavenly Court’s Gu Immortal Che Wei recently, and Fang Yuan’s attainment in it stays completely blank after he exhausts dream realms.",
      "chapters": [
        2154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "che-wei-creates-the-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_che_wei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Yu Xiu names Che Wei the creator of weapon path when judging endurance on Book Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        2163
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
